{%- comment -%}
SIMPLE LINK CARDS — same visual style as the intent cards (fd-intent-card),
but using each item's own image instead of a generic icon, for reference
content that links out (Taxonomies, Handbook).

Usage: {% include simple-link-cards.liquid data="taxonomies.index" %}
Each item needs: title, image, description, url. Optional: newtab.
{%- endcomment -%}
{% assign array = include.data | split: '.' %}
{% assign data = site.data %}
{% for key in array %}
  {% assign data = data[key] %}
{% endfor %}
<div class="fd-intents-grid simple-card-grid">
  {% for item in data %}
    <a class="fd-intent-card" href="{{ item.url }}" {% if item.newtab %}target="_blank" rel="noopener"{% endif %}>
      {% if item.image %}
        <span class="fd-intent-icon simple-card-icon"><img src="{{ item.image | relative_url }}" alt=""></span>
      {% endif %}
      <span class="fd-intent-title">{{ item.title }}</span>
      <span class="fd-intent-description">{{ item.description }}</span>
    </a>
  {% endfor %}
</div>
